error[E0152]: 'Account' declares 'init', so a row mapper cannot construct it: the mapper assigns fields directly, bypassing whatever 'init' enforces
  --> check_sql_row_init.bit:22:23
   |
22 |   let accounts = find<Account>(conn, "SELECT * FROM accounts")?
   |                       ^^^^^^^ map into a plain projection class instead, and construct 'Account' through 'init' yourself
