  --> check_sql_row_init.bit:28:23
   |
28 |   let accounts = find<ImportedAccount>(conn, "SELECT * FROM accounts")?
   |                       ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ map into a plain projection class instead, and construct 'RemoteAccount' through 'init' yourself
